Package: com.samcejko.kodium
Name: Kodium
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A code editor for jailbroken iOS 6: the VS Code workbench
 Kodium puts the VS Code workbench (the open-source editor, through
 monaco-vscode-api) on iOS 6 devices: files, editor tabs, search, the command
 palette, settings and keybindings. It runs on the device itself, with the
 engine of the Surfari browser (its own TLS 1.2 connections, modern CSS and
 JavaScript rewritten for the iOS 6 WebKit). Made for iOS 6.x on armv7 devices
 (the iPad 2). An early version.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Homepage: https://github.com/samcejko/kodium-ios6
Section: Productivity
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
Icon: file:///Applications/Kodium.app/Icon.png
